...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

action_agent: Action 에이전트 { class: ours }
assessment_agent: Assessment 에이전트 { class: ours }
followup_agent: Follow-up 에이전트 { class: ours }
gpt4o: GPT-4o { class: ext }

assessment_agent -> gpt4o: 본문 지시
gpt4o -> assessment_agent: Assessment 본문
assessment_agent -> action_agent: AFTER_WORK(register_hand_off 기본값, 1바퀴 진입)
action_agent -> gpt4o: 본문 지시
gpt4o -> action_agent: Action 섹션 본문(1바퀴)
action_agent -> followup_agent: AFTER_WORK 기본 이관
followup_agent -> gpt4o: 시스템 프롬프트(본문 지시) + 누적 요약
gpt4o -> followup_agent: Follow-up 섹션 본문(1바퀴)
followup_agent -> assessment_agent: AFTER_WORK(2바퀴 시작)
